WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.169 --> 00:00:08.169
Well, that brings us to the end of the course. Thank you for participating in the introduction to runtime animations for games.

2
00:00:08.169 --> 00:00:15.169
We've covered a lot of different topics here. So you've learned how to create an animation blueprint from scratch

3
00:00:15.169 --> 00:00:21.170
and understand what the AmiGraph and the EventGraph do.

4
00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:26.550
We've used a blend space to create a walk run cycle.

5
00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:30.550
And we've also explored using a state machine to create a jump cycle.

6
00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:37.549
And then finally we used a montage in order to trigger an animation from a key press.

7
00:00:37.549 --> 00:00:42.060
Thank you for joining us, and I hope you got some good value from the course.
